# The hosted page is built from web/, with the coin list in deployments/ and
# the simulator's charts and files in sim/. The pacemaker's function adds api/
# and bots/. Nothing else is uploaded.
/*
!/vercel.json
!/web
!/sim
!/deployments
# The pacemaker's second trigger (api/pace.mjs) and the bot code it runs.
!/api
!/bots
bots/.keys
bots/out
bots/node_modules
web/node_modules
web/dist
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
sim/target
sim/src
sim/Cargo.toml
